# Google Drive integration — see docs/google-drive-setup.md
# The client ID and project number are already in .env (committed). Copy this to .env.local
# (not committed) only to override them or to add the Picker API key, then restart `npm run dev`.
# You can also paste these in the app under Documents → Set up Google Drive.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
VITE_GOOGLE_API_KEY=
VITE_GOOGLE_APP_ID=
